Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.60,0:00:12.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《斯巴达克斯：血与沙》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.00,0:00:16.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《陷坑》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.50,0:00:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把我当傻瓜么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think me a fool?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.70,0:00:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.83,0:00:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你却不尊重我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet you dishonor me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.46,0:00:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我达成协议 许下誓言！\N{\fnArial\fs30}An agreement reached, an oath sworn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.36,0:00:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,获准参加角斗训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would submit to gladiatorial training.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.40,0:00:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫我主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call me master, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.13,0:00:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵守规则！\N{\fnArial\fs30}attend to the rules!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.33,0:01:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为回报 我去帮你找\N{\fnArial\fs30}In return, I would search for{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.56,0:01:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你心爱的妻子！\N{\fnArial\fs30}your precious wife!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.40,0:01:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你的急躁毁了你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}But your haste bested you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.13,0:01:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,藐视Doctore 用计争了个机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Defying Doctore, maneuvering to usurp gnaeus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.43,0:01:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,到竞技场上和Crixus对决\N{\fnArial\fs30}to face Crixus in the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.53,0:01:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的第一次角斗赛！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your first contest!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.96,0:01:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,和Crixus对打！\N{\fnArial\fs30}With Crixus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.46,0:01:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那要命的卡普亚战神！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The champion of fucking Capua!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.53,0:01:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I realize the mistake in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.16,0:01:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,知错？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mistake?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.50,0:01:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠 你万众瞩目！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck, you had the crowd!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.23,0:01:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你逃过了死刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You survived execution{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.86,0:01:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,打败了4个Solonius的人！\N{\fnArial\fs30}against four of Solonius' men!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.50,0:01:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你人尽皆知！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your name was on every tongue!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.66,0:01:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,可现在跟Crixus打过以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now after your showing with Crixus, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.30,0:01:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就成了笑柄！\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's spoken of with contempt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.23,0:01:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的小失误 会搞砸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your little mistake makes reunion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.06,0:01:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,和妻子重聚的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}with your wife problematic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.53,0:01:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有她的消息了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have knowledge of her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.76,0:01:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前只知道 那个从Glaber手上\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Syrian Glaber sold her to{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.40,0:01:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,买了她的叙利亚人向北去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}was last noted heading north.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.96,0:01:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还不知道他们的目的地\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've yet to divine their destination.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.80,0:01:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得接着找她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must keep searching for her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.30,0:02:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你毁了那么重要的约定\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shit on honorable agreements{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.66,0:02:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有脸向我提要求？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and press for fresh demands?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.16,0:02:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 色雷斯人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, Thracian, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.63,0:02:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果找到她 你愿为她的自由付多少钱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}how will you pay for her release if found?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.36,0:02:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她能回来呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her transport?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.56,0:02:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能下个金蛋来瞧瞧吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you shoot magic coins out of your ass?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.56,0:02:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是行的话 马上给我下出来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}If so, squat and produce!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.83,0:02:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会去竞技场角斗 我的赏金…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall fight in the arena, my winnings…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.53,0:02:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人乐意看你上场！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one wishes to see you fight!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.10,0:02:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,民众的喜爱 像风一样 稍纵即逝\N{\fnArial\fs30}The crowd's favor, like the wind, is fleeting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.66,0:02:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们对你没兴趣了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their interest in you has blown out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.23,0:02:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,天无绝人之路\N{\fnArial\fs30}There must be a way for me to fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.66,0:02:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一条路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.60,0:02:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,去那个不需要遵守规则的地方吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a place where you needn't follow rules, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.40,0:02:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为根本无规则可循\N{\fnArial\fs30}because none exist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.93,0:02:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,地下竞技赌场\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pits of the underworld.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.60,0:02:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,去那儿比试 不死的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fight there and survive, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.80,0:02:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就能赚得盆钵满盈\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you will fill both our hands with coin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.26,0:02:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.60,0:02:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许可以和妻子再度聚首哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}you may yet feel your wife's touch again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.83,0:03:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,色雷斯贱种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thracian bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.13,0:03:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Barca！放开他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barca! Release!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.26,0:03:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得 你应该把你妻子的绑带留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think your wife's binding should remain here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.60,0:03:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到那儿去 可能会把它弄丢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you're going, you might lose it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.16,0:03:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你的胳膊一起 不复存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Along with an arm. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.16,0:03:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他收拾妥当\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finish preparing him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.20,0:03:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能说句话么 主人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A word, Dominus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.00,0:03:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果快的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If hastened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.66,0:04:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,竞技赌场的流言将一日千里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The walls spread rumor of the pits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.83,0:04:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有异议？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You find objection to this course?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.26,0:04:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是个炼狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a place of pain and suffering, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.00,0:04:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,人命贱如草\N{\fnArial\fs30}beasts dying without honor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.96,0:04:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,您父亲绝不会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father would never have…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.96,0:04:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我意已定！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The decision is made!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.26,0:04:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果野人驯服不了 那就让他野个够\N{\fnArial\fs30}If a beast cannot be tamed, it must be unleashed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.86,0:04:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果雨季来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the rains ever return, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.20,0:04:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要好好淋上一个礼拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall soak in a bath for a week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.10,0:04:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 来点香水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahh, perfume.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.03,0:04:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,只剩几滴了 主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only a few drops remain, Domina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.03,0:04:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,给天神留着吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall save them for Jupiter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.23,0:04:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要用它祭坛祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will douse his altar and pray{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.70,0:04:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,让这香味引来洪水\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the scent sparks a deluge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.23,0:04:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到我的短剑没？它不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you seen my dagger? It eludes me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.96,0:04:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,要它来干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What purpose requires it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.86,0:04:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到条金河\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've divined an additional stream of revenue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.36,0:04:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以让我们痛快洗浴\N{\fnArial\fs30}One that will provide us a proper bath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.96,0:05:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那这条金河\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this stream, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.43,0:05:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,源自哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}it flows from what orifice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.26,0:05:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,竞技赌场\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.16,0:05:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,竞技赌场\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.33,0:05:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 只有Crixus一人在训练场一枝独秀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Crixus remains the single draw of the ludus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.73,0:05:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,在所有的新人理 Varro是唯一值得信任的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of the new recruits, Varro is the only man of promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.83,0:05:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯和Kerza 在竞技场显得毫无价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus and Kerza prove worthless in the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.20,0:05:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 我今晚让他俩去那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I fight them both tonight where they may yet{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.80,0:05:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许可以充实我们的钱包\N{\fnArial\fs30}fill our purse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.83,0:05:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Quintus呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quintus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.66,0:05:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,派遣特雷斯人 让我松了一口气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dispatching the Thracian brings me relief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.70,0:05:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经深陷竞技赌场 无法自拔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You descending into the pits does not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.00,0:05:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样会玷污名誉 也会威胁生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}It stains the name, and threatens the body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.06,0:05:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会受到很好的保护\N{\fnArial\fs30}My body will be well protected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.43,0:05:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Barca随身保护 随时准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barca looms over it, ready to break bone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.93,0:05:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,将来犯之人撕成碎片\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the slightest provocation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.73,0:05:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉Barca 如果你有什么闪失\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inform Barca that if you return scathed, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.76,0:05:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就把他弟弟切下来装罐子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have his cock in a jar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.70,0:05:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,信息会被忠实地传达到位\N{\fnArial\fs30}The message will be dutifully delivered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.43,0:05:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚给Crixus一个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give Crixus a woman tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.60,0:05:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,刺激下其他人 让他们知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Motivation to the others that success brings{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.56,0:05:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,胜利可以带来很多好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}decoration in many forms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.00,0:05:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来看他享受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see him well satisfied.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.70,0:06:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 你他妈的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep moving you fuck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.60,0:06:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要带他去哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do they take him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.83,0:06:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,去地下赌场 属于他的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the underworld, where he belongs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.56,0:06:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,专心训练！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back to training!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.73,0:06:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 我可不像你这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me I don't look like I have been shit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.36,0:06:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟被操死的野猪肉一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}from a boar's ass like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.53,0:06:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要死在竞技赌场\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not dying in the pits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.86,0:06:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要给他们看看 我他妈是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll show these fucking cunts my cock{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.60,0:07:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,经过火神千锤百炼的\N{\fnArial\fs30}was forged in Vulcan's flames.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.13,0:07:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把他们全操一遍！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will fuck them all!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.30,0:07:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,撕开他的屁股！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tear his ass open!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.50,0:07:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,砸烂他的头！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rip his head off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.30,0:07:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来 起来 你这没用的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up, get up, you useless…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.16,0:07:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.10,0:08:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!{\r}
