Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.93,0:08:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ovidius 很高兴你也下赌啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ovidius, good to lay eyes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.63,0:08:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也希望早点下赌啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had expected them laid earlier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.03,0:08:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们协议说的可是 你要在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our agreement calls for repayment of your debt{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.53,0:08:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,火神节比赛结束后的第二天\N{\fnArial\fs30}plus thirty percent, to be delivered{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.26,0:08:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,把欠我的债和三分利 一起还给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}the day after the games of the Vulcanalia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.53,0:08:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我却发现你在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet I find you here, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.26,0:08:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,赌注你还欠着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wagering coin still owed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.63,0:08:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你保证 你会第一个收到应付款\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be first to receive what is due, I assure you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.80,0:08:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,双面神说的都是假话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Words spewed by Janus, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.70,0:08:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论从哪边的脸说出来 都一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}from both sides of his face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.53,0:08:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很快会收到钱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be repaid soon enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.60,0:08:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你想自找麻烦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless you'd care to press the matter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.90,0:09:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你就自便吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}At your convenience then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.73,0:09:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管到什么时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until such time, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.66,0:09:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,利息依然照算\N{\fnArial\fs30}the points still accrue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.76,0:09:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,拽个屁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ass eating shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.30,0:09:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,再敢这样跟我说话 我把你打成猪头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speak to me such again, I will accrue your fucking head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.46,0:09:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ixion 获胜！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ixion, victor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.03,0:09:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁敢跟我打？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to face me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.46,0:10:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿天神眷顾你 色雷斯人\N{\fnArial\fs30}May the gods fare you better, Thracian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.83,0:10:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,也眷顾我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}For both our sakes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.10,0:10:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没戴我送你的礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your neck is bare of my gift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.66,0:10:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.66,0:10:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 是你不喜欢它？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did not favor it, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.56,0:10:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不喜欢我送你的项链？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The necklace I gave you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.93,0:10:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,小声点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lower your voice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.43,0:10:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的礼物 我不能接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your gift, I cannot accept it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.80,0:10:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pardon my mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.10,0:10:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该知道 如果主人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must understand, if Domina…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.73,0:10:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经解释清楚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've made your intention clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.56,0:10:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会激动吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it excite you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.76,0:10:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,当得知你的脚步 可以让我\N{\fnArial\fs30}To know that your very footsteps{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.76,0:10:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,心潮澎湃的时候？\N{\fnArial\fs30}moisten my thighs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.93,0:11:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会让你更澎湃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have them dripping even more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.03,0:11:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就赶紧过来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well draw closer and make it so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.56,0:11:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你握着什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you clutching?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.63,0:11:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我瞧瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.60,0:11:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个寒碜的礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}A humble gift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.40,0:11:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,送给我的女神\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a goddess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.90,0:11:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我戴上吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put it on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.16,0:11:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开心吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it please you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.90,0:11:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.56,0:12:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼观困兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Witness the captive beasts, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.66,0:12:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们饮血止渴吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}quenching our thirst with blood!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.86,0:12:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,在竞技赌场死去…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Set to die in the pits…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.00,0:12:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他们逆天而生的报应！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Payment for their offensive births!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.00,0:12:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,让死神重新降临吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let death descend anew!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.93,0:12:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,有请 Myrmex！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behold, Myrmex!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.70,0:13:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,有请 斯巴达克斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behold, Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.00,0:13:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家似乎不喜欢他\N{\fnArial\fs30}The crowd does not seem to favor him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.20,0:13:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在竞技场捅了那篓子后 这样不奇怪吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would they, after his showing in the arena?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.63,0:13:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,上天\N{\fnArial\fs30}What weapons{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.03,0:13:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,将赐予他们何种武器？\N{\fnArial\fs30}shall the gods bless them with?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.06,0:13:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,亦或天谴他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or curse them{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.93,0:13:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,空手作战！\N{\fnArial\fs30}with empty hands!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.60,0:13:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,为自己的命运做出选择吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Choose your fate!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.53,0:13:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Myrmex选了钢刺手套！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Myrmex draws sphairai!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.23,0:13:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯选了铜圈手套！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus draws caestus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.70,0:13:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Myrmex更占优势\N{\fnArial\fs30}Myrmex has the advantage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.70,0:14:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你的多嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for the fucking obvious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.53,0:14:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只有一条简单的规则！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have but a single rule!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.96,0:14:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能有一个活下来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only one survives!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.56,0:14:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,撕扯对战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mongrel on mongrel, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.70,0:14:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到死神降临！\N{\fnArial\fs30}till Charon arrives! {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.46,0:14:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,赔率是怎么定的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you make of the odds?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.23,0:14:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我方4：1的赔率\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four to one against our man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.43,0:14:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许是5：1\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe five.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.83,0:14:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,在斯巴达克斯身上 押10迪纳币\N{\fnArial\fs30}Place ten denarii on Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.73,0:14:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望能有大回报\N{\fnArial\fs30}And pray for ample return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.23,0:14:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵命 主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.53,0:15:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,还手呀！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do something!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.43,0:15:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯！胜利！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus! Victor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.96,0:15:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他稍事休息 再打\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give him a moment's rest, then fight him again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.63,0:16:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're hurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.20,0:16:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.13,0:16:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,别把自己逼得太狠了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You push yourself too far.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.86,0:16:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet I live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.73,0:16:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,还能活多久？\N{\fnArial\fs30}For how long?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.80,0:16:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,能有多久 就多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as it takes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.36,0:16:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就把他们全杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then kill them all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.83,0:16:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还想回竞技赌场去吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you plan to return to the pits?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.06,0:16:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们让我们赚得盆钵满盈…\N{\fnArial\fs30}They fill our hands with coin…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.36,0:17:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且还能赚得更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}With yet more to be mined.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.40,0:17:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,满盘皆输的那天该怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what when the shaft caves in on you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.40,0:17:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那该怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.20,0:17:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道法律的规定 没有继承人的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the law, without an heir{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.50,0:17:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得被迫嫁给别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd be forced to marry another.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.53,0:17:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你希望这样吗？让别人来碰我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what you want? Someone else's hands upon me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.40,0:17:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要天下万物！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want everything!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.16,0:17:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,可现在什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet can afford nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.83,0:17:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只在乎你 Quintus\N{\fnArial\fs30}My concerns only with you, Quintus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.70,0:17:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果没有你 我肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're lost, my reason for breath{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.90,0:17:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,活不下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}would surely follow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.20,0:17:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我活得好好儿的 别想那些触霉头的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remain firmly rooted, banish it from thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.53,0:17:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯玩儿完 我就收手\N{\fnArial\fs30}When Spartacus ends, so does my time in the pits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.20,0:17:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时 他早给我们赚够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Till then, his victories swell our purse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.33,0:17:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快又会被你花光的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which you deflate with new purchases.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.23,0:17:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这小玩意儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This simple thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.30,0:17:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今天才找回来的 可开心呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Its rediscovery today pleased me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.96,0:17:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我妈妈的 当初跟她的东西一起不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was my mother's, lost amongst her things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.00,0:17:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不求奢华的女人 真让人怀念啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}A woman of modest taste, sorely missed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.00,0:18:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我们该把那条 从Ramel那儿买的翡翠项链\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps we should return the emerald necklace{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.83,0:18:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,退给他吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}we bought from Ramel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.20,0:18:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 它没啥用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it was excessive, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.93,0:18:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果钱能让你赶紧从竞技赌场抽身的话 我会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and if the coin will help speed you from the pits I'd be…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.33,0:18:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,两条都留着吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep them both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.26,0:18:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让我太太 把珠宝退回去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not have my wife return jewelry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.30,0:18:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去洗个澡 我身上有死人的味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should wash, I smell of death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.60,0:18:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你身上那是男人味\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you smell like a man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.46,0:18:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.96,0:18:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你 他不会死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you he would.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.03,0:19:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kerza怎样了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What of Kerza?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.26,0:19:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,输了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fallen, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.60,0:19:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,再也起不来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}never to rise whole. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.83,0:19:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是角斗士睡觉的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where gladiators sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.93,0:19:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是给狗睡的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not dogs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.70,0:19:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说话注意点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold your tongue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.83,0:19:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算他现在没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}He stays, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.10,0:19:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,早晚也要跟着Kerza下地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}he wakes beside Kerza in the afterlife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.63,0:19:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.13,0:19:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,别理那些混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pay no mind to those inbred fucks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.13,0:19:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说得没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}They speak the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.63,0:19:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不再是角斗士了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am no longer a gladiator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.10,0:19:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是个男子汉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are still a man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.86,0:19:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.93,0:19:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,值得人尊敬的男子汉\N{\fnArial\fs30}One deserving respect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.06,0:19:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得竞技赌场那种地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Though I'll grant the pits could force{\r}
