Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.23,0:29:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得她不会注意吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you think she would not notice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.10,0:29:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我误会你把它还给我的意思了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I misunderstood your meaning in returning it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.56,0:29:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当然误会了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course you misunderstood!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.30,0:29:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,竞技场之外 你什么都不懂！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no mind outside the arena!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.00,0:29:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只关注你的剑和盾牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think only with your sword and your shield, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.46,0:29:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个笨蛋 傻瓜…\N{\fnArial\fs30}you stupid, lumbering…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.56,0:29:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a fool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.03,0:29:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,警卫！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guard!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.36,0:30:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个可活！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only one survives!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.33,0:30:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,杂种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mongrel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.56,0:30:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.76,0:30:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,获胜！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Victor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.30,0:30:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要多久？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much longer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.93,0:30:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们获得自由前 还要流多少血？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much blood until we're free?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.96,0:30:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,就快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.70,0:30:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向你保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.60,0:30:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有想着抱着你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the thought of holding you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.76,0:30:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉你在我怀里…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feeling you against me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.33,0:31:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有这样 我才觉得自己还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only thing that keeps my heart beating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.66,0:31:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看上去萎靡不振\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look like shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.63,0:31:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还扛得住\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've endured worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.03,0:31:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁能扛得住\N{\fnArial\fs30}What man could, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.56,0:31:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还把自己当这世上的人看吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and still count himself of this world?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.73,0:31:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个世界 满是痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}This world. All it holds is suffering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.73,0:31:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有一天会结束的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will end one day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.56,0:31:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会再聚首的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we will be reunited.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.30,0:31:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为角斗士吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}As gladiators?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.93,0:31:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这主意倒不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}A welcomed thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.20,0:31:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是支持我活着的唯一信念\N{\fnArial\fs30}One that keeps me from the grasp of the afterlife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.90,0:31:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看上去可不太妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your condition speaks to its encroachment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.66,0:31:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是曼德拉草根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mandrake root, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.20,0:31:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,从Ashur那儿弄到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}acquired from Ashur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.43,0:31:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,嚼着可以止痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chewed to numb the pain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.10,0:31:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.36,0:31:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.23,0:32:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要保持意识清醒 来救你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need what remains of my senses to save you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.66,0:32:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,救我干啥？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save me from what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.33,0:32:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.43,0:32:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你的好意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your offer is well received.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.00,0:32:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我心领了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even in the turning away of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.10,0:32:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯赚回来这么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus handsomely returns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.63,0:32:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些钱够还债了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will the sum balance our debts?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.96,0:32:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管挣了这么多…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The scales are well nudged…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.33,0:32:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是还债？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But balanced?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.23,0:32:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.03,0:32:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,把其它债都还了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pay out the most egregious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.23,0:32:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,但先别还Ovidius的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But leave Ovidius with empty fucking hands. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.30,0:32:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ovidius么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ovidius?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.76,0:32:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,行政官的兄弟？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The magistrate's cousin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.30,0:32:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺晚了 你该去睡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should be in bed, the hour is late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.06,0:32:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还欠了他的债\N{\fnArial\fs30}And our debts follow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.96,0:32:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果欠着Ovidius的债…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If money is owed to Ovidius…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.53,0:32:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那到期就该还清\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then it will be paid, in due course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.80,0:32:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个人侮辱了我 我可不会以德报怨\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man offered me insult and I won't reward it with it swift coin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.00,0:33:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,没搞错吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that wise?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.30,0:33:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他向行政官诉苦 我担心…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he complains to the magistrate, I worry…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.20,0:33:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是一家之主 这些事留给我烦就好！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the paterfamilias, the worry is mine alone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.50,0:33:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你每天早上醒过来都这样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that how you woke this morning?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.00,0:33:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.46,0:33:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没在你旁边吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was I not by your side?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.96,0:33:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lucretia啊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucretia…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.80,0:33:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些钱 你是怎么弄来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you come to possess those coins?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.63,0:33:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lucretia啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucretia!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.30,0:33:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lucretia啊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucretia…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.00,0:33:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,从Ramel那儿弄来的 如果你非要知道的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}From Ramel, if you must know, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.26,0:33:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去退了那条翡翠项链\N{\fnArial\fs30}in exchange for the emerald necklace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.63,0:33:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明令告诉过你 别做这种事！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I commanded you to do no such thing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.23,0:33:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,明令？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commanded?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.46,0:33:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把我错当成奴隶了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mistake me for a slave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.03,0:33:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我不是这意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know my intentions better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.00,0:33:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lucretia 那些翡翠…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucretia, the emeralds…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.06,0:33:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你戴着很漂亮的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They looked lovely on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.70,0:33:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,去把它们弄回来吧 破费点小钱而已…\N{\fnArial\fs30}To see them returned, a casualty of ill finances…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.86,0:33:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,错在我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fault was mine, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.60,0:33:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,天天想着买东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}in pressing the purchase in the first place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.20,0:33:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的烦恼 就是我的烦恼 Quintus\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your worries are my worries, Quintus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.86,0:33:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从来都不是一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are never alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.06,0:33:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真贴心\N{\fnArial\fs30}A notion to warm the heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.93,0:33:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,翡翠项链\N{\fnArial\fs30}The emerald necklace, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.16,0:33:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,退了多少钱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}what did it bring?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.26,0:34:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,14迪纳币\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fourteen denarii.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.63,0:34:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,才14？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fourteen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.00,0:34:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,前几天买的时候 可花了两倍钱那么多啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Days past it commanded twice that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.50,0:34:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,女人一碰生意 就是这么个结果！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Women and business, and these are the results!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.90,0:34:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Solonius路过的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}An offer for the full price was made by Solonius, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.53,0:34:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,本想原价买去\N{\fnArial\fs30}who happened by.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.93,0:34:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我难道应该卖给他吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better business had I accepted?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.50,0:34:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该再多要一点的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You struck the wiser bargain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.46,0:34:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Solonius知道你参与竞技赌场的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Solonius knows of your activities in the pits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.96,0:34:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在全城的人都知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole city does by now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.26,0:34:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们去说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let their tongues wag.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.40,0:34:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,赢的钱可以把训练场的债还清\N{\fnArial\fs30}The winnings will return this ludus to solvency.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.86,0:34:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后 我们就可以堵上Solonius和他那些人的嘴了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we'll have at Solonius and all his shit eaters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.70,0:34:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个色雷斯人能坚持多久？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long can the Thracian last?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.63,0:34:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,照那样下去 只有几天而已吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}A handful of nights, if that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.43,0:34:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算是具行尸走肉 早晚也得玩完\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even the walking dead eventually return to the grave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.70,0:34:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他送回竞技赌场去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send him back to the pits!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.53,0:34:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是角斗士！\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not a fucking gladiator!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.26,0:35:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.83,0:35:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着它 斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here take it, Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.60,0:35:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干得不错 斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have fought well, Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.23,0:35:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,神明会奖赏你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gods reward you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.90,0:35:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,承诺兑现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The promise is kept.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.80,0:35:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sura啊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sura…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.40,0:35:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会永远和你在一起…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will always be with you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.03,0:35:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪怕是死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even in death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.30,0:36:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,暴雨要来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rains are coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.10,0:36:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.66,0:36:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,在它们冲走一切迹象之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before they wash everything away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.06,0:36:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sura啊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sura…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.56,0:36:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.10,0:36:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.10,0:36:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在没多少斗志了 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not so much fight in him now, is there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.93,0:36:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在为竞技赌场蓄势待发\N{\fnArial\fs30}He saves his fury for the pits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.13,0:36:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那地方 你早晚要死\N{\fnArial\fs30}A place you wouldn't last a fucking breath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.50,0:36:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.90,0:36:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've fought well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.83,0:36:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,神明终将赐福于你\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gods may yet reward you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.13,0:37:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,神明\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.20,0:37:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们昨晚显灵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They came to me last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.53,0:37:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在我的梦中\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.86,0:37:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,神明向你释意何事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did they show you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.93,0:37:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}The truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.26,0:37:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你用我的命赚钱一事 今晚到头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your profit from my blood ends tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.43,0:37:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你若拒绝出战 我将停止\N{\fnArial\fs30}Refuse to fight, and I will cease my attempts{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.60,0:37:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,搜寻你妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}to find your wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.63,0:37:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须救她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to save her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.63,0:37:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,在暴雨来临前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before the rains come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.43,0:37:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,少跟我说胡话 你这个疯子！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give way to your meaning, you mad fuck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.30,0:37:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的赔率依旧居高不下？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The odds remain high in my favor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.40,0:37:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.23,0:37:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就将赌注全部押到我身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then bet everything you have against me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.80,0:37:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会死在竞技赌场吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would die in the pits?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.90,0:37:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会愿意让我时来运转？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Willingly, to see my fortune rise?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.76,0:37:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 只要你愿意继续从叙利亚人那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, if you will hold to wrest my wife{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.46,0:37:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,寻找我妻子 哪怕消息少得可怜\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the Syrian with a piece of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.40,0:37:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦你死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's to keep me to this bargain{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.50,0:37:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我干嘛还要继续这么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}once your blood is spilled?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.06,0:37:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了荣誉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.23,0:37:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 若是你违背了承诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the promise of vengeance from the afterlife{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.60,0:37:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做鬼也不放过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you betray it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.30,0:38:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,成交\N{\fnArial\fs30}The deal is struck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.80,0:38:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,带着你的诚意出战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make it appear a sincere fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.96,0:38:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮他准备妥当\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finish preparing him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.43,0:38:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,看哪…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behold…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.80,0:38:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.80,0:39:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有Ixion！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behold, Ixion!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.86,0:39:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,赌注已下？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The wager is placed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.20,0:39:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,已分散下到各个赌盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sum has been spread among{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.53,0:39:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,以防引起怀疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}the brokers to ease suspicion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.46,0:39:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,神明将会\N{\fnArial\fs30}What weapons{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.93,0:39:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,赐予他们何种武器？\N{\fnArial\fs30}shall the gods bless them with?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.33,0:39:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是天谴他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or curse them{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.16,0:39:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,空手作战？\N{\fnArial\fs30}with empty hands?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.33,0:39:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,命运掌握在你们自己手里！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Choose your fate!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.43,0:39:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ixion选择战斧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ixion draws bipennis!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.70,0:39:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯选择弯剑！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus draws sica!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.53,0:39:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,规则只有一条！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have but a single rule!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.00,0:39:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能有一个活下来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only one survives!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.86,0:40:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,相互厮打\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mongrel on mongrel, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.53,0:40:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到死神降临！\N{\fnArial\fs30}till Charon arrives!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.66,0:41:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,早着呢 早着呢…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet, not yet…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.03,0:41:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.36,0:42:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,明明有侍卫 却还让我站在这儿流血！\N{\fnArial\fs30}My protector, and here I stand bloodied!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.83,0:42:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没发觉还有旁人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did not see there was another.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.40,0:42:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须确保我万无一失！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must see all when my life is in the balance!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.66,0:43:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,两只眼睛给我瞪大点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ring your crown with eyes, or have the two you possess{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.96,0:43:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我替你全挖出来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}ripped from your fucking skull!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.43,0:43:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们皮肤上有烙印 主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their flesh carries a brand, Dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.20,0:43:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,代表什么含义？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of what origin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.70,0:43:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfamiliar, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.73,0:43:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但可以确定是奴隶的烙印\N{\fnArial\fs30}but certainly the mark of a slave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.33,0:43:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,奴隶？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slaves?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.46,0:43:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们派\N{\fnArial\fs30}They send{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.76,0:43:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的普通奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}common fucking slaves{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.26,0:43:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,来杀Batiatus！\N{\fnArial\fs30}to kill Batiatus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.56,0:43:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的普通奴隶？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Common fucking slaves?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.70,0:43:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.93,0:43:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我靠！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.70,0:43:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到他们的主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Discover their master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.80,0:43:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要问清楚这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish to have words with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.13,0:43:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,朱诺的唇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Juno's lips, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.10,0:43:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,朱诺的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Juno's heart, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.73,0:43:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,朱诺的腹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Juno's belly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.33,0:43:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kalends are upon us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.30,0:44:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个月的第一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first day of the new month.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.80,0:44:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,敬上祭品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare a sacrifice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.80,0:44:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许神明会赐予我们一个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps the gods will finally grace us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.66,0:44:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为回报…\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a child in return…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.90,0:44:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Quintus啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quintus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.33,0:44:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 没什么 一个小麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye, it's nothing, a minor annoyance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.70,0:44:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,小麻烦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Minor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.26,0:44:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么提到孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you speak of children, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.76,0:44:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,还差点让我成了寡妇？\N{\fnArial\fs30}yet press to make me a widow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.53,0:44:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要我死\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will take more than a scratch{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.10,0:44:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这点小伤算什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}to wrest me from your side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.56,0:44:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说了 快坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barely more, sit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.83,0:44:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 谁那么该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}And tell me who must die in response.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.26,0:44:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀手已经开赴赌场\N{\fnArial\fs30}The agents have already been dispatched to the underworld.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.66,0:44:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不知道谁是幕后主使\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hand behind them yet to be revealed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.60,0:44:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我警告过你 竞技赌场很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}I warned you of the dangers of the pits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.40,0:44:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为今晚之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had thought to erase all our debts{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.10,0:44:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能还清所有债务\N{\fnArial\fs30}through them after tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.63,0:44:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯打算全力一搏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus offered terms to see it so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.86,0:44:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,搏什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What terms?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.43,0:44:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他连命都押上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}His willing death to wager upon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.06,0:44:50.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,只为找到他的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Locating his wife the crux of the bargain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.93,0:44:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个色雷斯人死了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Thracian is dead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.80,0:44:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 他还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he yet lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.50,0:45:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但赌注没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the wager is lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.93,0:45:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,多少？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.33,0:45:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,很大一笔\N{\fnArial\fs30}A substantial sum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.90,0:45:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没拿到！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.43,0:45:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个色雷斯人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That Thracian…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.80,0:45:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他带给我们家族的 尽是耻辱！\N{\fnArial\fs30}He brings nothing but shame on our house!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.73,0:45:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,若不是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were it not for him, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.10,0:45:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你早就成寡妇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you would be a widow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.23,0:45:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他今天在竞技赌场救了我的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}He saved my life in the pits this night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.63,0:45:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,若不是因为他 你永远不会去那种地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}A place you would never have been if it weren't for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.63,0:45:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被诅咒了 他受到天谴\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is cursed, he is cursed by the gods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.93,0:45:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我盼着他死呢 他早就该死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would see his life ended, as it should have been{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.60,0:45:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他迈入竞技场时 就注定受死\N{\fnArial\fs30}when he stepped into the arena, doomed for execution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.50,0:45:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要这个色雷斯人多活一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every day that the Thracian yet lives, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.00,0:45:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怕噩运就会降临到咱们头上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fear that his curse becomes our own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.23,0:45:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.83,0:45:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人传唤你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Batiatus summons you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.40,0:46:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妻子认为你受到天谴了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My wife thinks you are cursed by the gods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.00,0:46:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得也像\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm inclined to agree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.73,0:46:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll find no argument.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.76,0:46:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,理智的做法是 在你影响到我之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rational course would be to end your miserable life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.06,0:46:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束你悲惨的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}before it further infects mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.10,0:46:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已给过承诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}A promise was made, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.53,0:46:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会去找Sura\N{\fnArial\fs30}you would find Sura.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.90,0:46:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,前提是如果你死在竞技赌场\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you died in the pits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.30,0:46:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你还在这儿站着呢 活生生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet here you stand, alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.96,0:46:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}As do you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.16,0:46:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺言仍然有效\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promise is kept.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.40,0:46:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会继续搜寻她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will continue the search for her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.33,0:46:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救了我的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.83,0:46:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,欠债还钱 天经地义\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gods or not, a debt demands repayment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.73,0:47:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一旦康复 就让他重归角斗士队伍吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's to rejoin the gladiators as soon as he is able.{\r}
